==================================================
CurvJeans vs Regular Jeans Comparison Section
- Auto-detects language from URL (/de, /nl, or default EN)
- Mobile: Stacked comparison
- Desktop: Side-by-side with overlay feature grid
==================================================
{% endcomment %}

<div class="cj-compare-wrapper" data-lang="en">

  <!-- HEADLINE -->
